    FEAT-0001: add a DataScientist role
    
    DataScientist is one more kind of single person: it implements Employee
    the same way the other roles do, and Grace now has one on her team.
    
    Manager didn't change. Before, a new role meant a new array in Manager
    plus a new loop in traverse(), getTotalSalary() and getHeadcount().

